    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="28">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 28</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif feorran[-]cumen man oþþe fræmde buton wege gange, ⁊ he þonne nawðer ne hyrme ne he horn ne blawe, for ðeof he bið to profianne, oþþe to sleanne oþþe to alysenne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a man [who is] come from afar or a stranger should go off the track, and he then neither calls out nor does he blow a horn, he is to be regarded as a thief, either to be killed or to be redeemed.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif feorran cumen man oþþe fræmde buton wege gange ⁊ he þonne nawðer ne hyrme ne he horn ne blawe, for ðeof he bið to profianne: oþþe to sleanne oþþe to alysenne.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
